    "steps": [
        {
            "step_number": 1,
            "title": "Light Bulb",
            "images": [
                "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/YbbqOBQZIwArhdWF.medium",
                "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/cwrikM6oVppEjTEX.medium",
                "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/WVJapenFvobfwnSQ.medium"
            ],
            "images_alt": [
                "Dome Ceiling Light Bulb Replacement, Light Bulb: step 1, image 1 of 3",
                "Dome Ceiling Light Bulb Replacement, Light Bulb: step 1, image 2 of 3",
                "Dome Ceiling Light Bulb Replacement, Light Bulb: step 1, image 3 of 3"
            ],
            "thumbnails": [
                "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/YbbqOBQZIwArhdWF.200x150",
                "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/cwrikM6oVppEjTEX.200x150",
                "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/WVJapenFvobfwnSQ.200x150"
            ],
            "instructions": [
                "Before you start anything, make sure that the light switch has been turned off to avoid any electrical problems.",
                "Gently turn the light in a counterclockwise direction with a gloved hand.",
                "If the light is stuck, you can use the the grippier sole of a shoe to lightly nudge the light loose.",
                "When the light starts moving enough, spin the light counterclockwise with the glove until it comes off."
            ],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/140075/278864",
            "comments": {
                "add_comment_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/Dome+Ceiling+Light+Bulb+Replacement/",
                "add_comment_text": "Add a comment"
            }
        },
        {
            "step_number": 2,
            "title": "",
            "images": [
                "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/GfINfFTi6jBUVcaG.medium",
                "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/Cr6OQWCdIdIIowjl.medium",
                "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/VDcooHys2utyAFtv.medium"
            ],
            "thumbnails": [
                "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/GfINfFTi6jBUVcaG.200x150",
                "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/Cr6OQWCdIdIIowjl.200x150",
                "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/VDcooHys2utyAFtv.200x150"
            ],
            "images_alt": [
                "Dome Ceiling Light Bulb Replacement: step 2, image 1 of 3",
                "Dome Ceiling Light Bulb Replacement: step 2, image 2 of 3",
                "Dome Ceiling Light Bulb Replacement: step 2, image 3 of 3"
            ],
            "instructions": [
                "Put the lid on a soft safe surface.",
                "Get the rag or cloth wet in order to wipe down the lid.",
                "Clean the lid inside and out."
            ],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/140075/278866",
            "comments": {
                "add_comment_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/Dome+Ceiling+Light+Bulb+Replacement/",
                "add_comment_text": "Add a comment"
            }
        },
        {
            "step_number": 3,
            "title": "",
            "instructions": [
                "Turn the light on without the cover to determine which bulb is blown out.",
                "You can also check if the light looks black near the connection as a symbol it is going bad."
            ],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/140075/278869",
            "comments": {
                "add_comment_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/Dome+Ceiling+Light+Bulb+Replacement/",
                "add_comment_text": "Add a comment"
            }
        },
        {
            "step_number": 4,
            "title": "",
            "instructions": [
                "Turn off the power from the circuit breaker and turn off any light switches that provide power to the item you’re working on."
            ],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/140075/289003",
            "comments": {
                "add_comment_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/Dome+Ceiling+Light+Bulb+Replacement/",
                "add_comment_text": "Add a comment"
            }
        },
        {
            "step_number": 5,
            "title": "",
            "instructions": [
                "Pull out the old burnt light, being sure not to drop it.",
                "Plug the new replacement light into the plug in the light fixture.",
                "In my case the bulb was a 120v 13w 4100k. This can very depending on model of light unit.",
                "Watch how your light is supposed to match up with the plug when putting the new light in."
            ],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/140075/278872",
            "comments": {
                "add_comment_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/Dome+Ceiling+Light+Bulb+Replacement/",
                "add_comment_text": "Add a comment"
            }
        },
        {
            "step_number": 6,
            "title": "",
            "instructions": [
                "Turn on the light and make sure both lights turn on. If it doesn't turn on try pushing in the light more—it's a common error when installing."
            ],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/140075/278873",
            "comments": {
                "add_comment_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/Dome+Ceiling+Light+Bulb+Replacement/",
                "add_comment_text": "Add a comment"
            }
        },
        {
            "step_number": 7,
            "title": "",
            "instructions": [
                "Spin the lid clockwise with your gloved hand until you can't turn it anymore.",
                "Hit the lid clockwise with the heel of the shoe to tighten up the lid and avoid any accidents and loose ends."
            ],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/140075/278875",
            "comments": {
                "add_comment_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/Dome+Ceiling+Light+Bulb+Replacement/",
                "add_comment_text": "Add a comment"
            }
        },
        {
            "step_number": 8,
            "title": "",
            "instructions": [
                "Using the wet rag or cloth, again clean up the light to remove any shoe marks you might have caused in the process.",
                "Turn on light and watch your hard work glow!"
            ],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/140075/278878",
            "comments": {
                "add_comment_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/Dome+Ceiling+Light+Bulb+Replacement/",
                "add_comment_text": "Add a comment"
            }
        }
    ],
    "conclusion": "To reassemble your device, follow these instructions in reverse order.",
